%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 7: Ana waits for ten
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 107 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/dusk cb-light
% a lonelier beat: the camera turns from the harbour to the open sea
cb-HZ cb-harbour-sky
-9 650 cb-DECK cb-RAIL cb-pier
% the gulls have settled on the rail posts
[380 460 540] { cb-DECK cb-RAIL add 1 add 20 cb-gull-sit } forall
70 cb-DECK 150 cb-mama
300 cb-DECK 100 cb-ana
cb-paper cb-rgb
(The gulls go quiet. Ana waits for ten.) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
/cb-foliorgb cb-paper def 7 cb-folio
showpage
